  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CCMP in Kenya: Next phase interventions - Consolidation and ToT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is a second phase of a previous intervention where people drawn from the churches were trained as church and community mobilization (CCMP) coordinators. To strengthen their work with the church and communities and to enhance sustainability, some of these coordinators will be trained to be CCMP ToTs in this phase of the project. The ToTs will be expected to train other church leaders and congregants to strengthen CCMP in the communities and enhance scope of reach.</narrative>
  </description>
